settings.danger.title = Danger zone
settings.danger.personal = Reset my imported data
settings.danger.personal_hint = Undoes every statement imported into your accounts and deletes what they made, so you can upload them again from scratch. Your accounts, categories, rules and anything you entered by hand stay. This can't be undone.
